    "summary": "**[DEVASTATING WOUNDS: MONSTER/VEHICLE](vsdata:weapon-ability/devastating-wounds-monster-vehicle)**. The effect applies only if the target unit has **MONSTER** or **VEHICLE**. A critical wound bypasses saves and converts the attack’s Damage to mortal wounds after ordinary damage. Allocate the attack’s mortal wounds to one model and discard excess once it dies. **[Feel No Pain](vsdata:core-ability/feel-no-pain)** still works.",
